### 5 MECANICO INTENTA CREAR CLIENTE
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clientes/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMecanico.response.body.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre": "Cliente Test 3",
    "rut": "99999888-9",
    "telefono": "999999988",
    "email": "test3@test.cl"
}


### 6 CLIENTE INTENTA CREAR ORDEN
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ordenes/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCliente.response.body.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "vehiculo": 1,
    "mecanico": 1,
    "descripcion": "Prueba cliente no autorizado",
    "fecha_entrega_estimada": "2026-05-25"
}


### 7 MECANICO INTENTA COMPLETAR ORDEN AJENA
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/ordenes/1/completar/
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMecanico.response.body.access}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "monto": 85000,
    "fecha_entrega_real": "2026-05-20"
}


